Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Festival budaya SMA Putri Mitsurugi\Ntelah berakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Acara penutupan diadakan di alun-alun.\N- Tadi itu seru!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, ya, tadi aku ada kendala\Ndan tak bisa kembali ke kelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana dengan kafenya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sangat ramai!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menu apa yang paling diminati?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pisang Bakar buatan Matsurika!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Hutan Elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matsurika?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada aurora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah hantu, sekarang aurora?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus lapor ke markas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada bencana alam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada yang sedang mencoba\Nmembuka pintu dimensi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langit itu... berbahaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Asahina?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:01:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langit itu... sama seperti\Nsaat dunia kita terdistorsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Distorsi ruang dan waktu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Firasatku tidak enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya firasatku benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor juga bilang hal yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu.\NBerarti ini mengkhawatirkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gedung itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasakan sihir yang kuat\Ndi tempat bercahaya itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor!\NKamu baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kondisiku tidak enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian duluan saja dan tinggalkan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.\NIstirahatlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serahkan ini pada kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Firasatku bilang hal buruk akan terjadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wahai dimensi, saatnya untuk menyatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inilah kelahiran dunia baru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu!\NTernyata pelakunya memang kamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyihir Ramalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, Amou Arata
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dari Earth 13!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu kenal aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, kamu juga manusia\Ndari Earth 13, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi semua ini ulahmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang akan menciptakan ulang dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.55,0:03:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beberapa retakan dimensi muncul\Ndi dunia kalian,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:04:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan salah satunya terhubung\Ndengan duniaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, setelah datang ke dunia ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku terus memperbanyak retakan dimensinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini gerbang milik Takanashi Ayame?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu hasilnya adalah aurora ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini distorsi dimensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fenomena yang terjadi saat beberapa\Nmultisemesta saling mendekat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Multisemesta saling mendekat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar! Setelah ini,\Nberbagai dimensi akan menyatu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dunia baru akan lahir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pasti akan menghentikannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini mustahil untuk dihentikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Magical Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihirnya terserap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi itu sihir yang bisa\Nmembelokkan ruang dan dimensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.\NDia menggunakan sihir dimensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga bisa menghilangkan serangan\Nke dimensi lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, aku juga bisa\Nmengeluarkan sihir yang sebelumnya
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sudah kusimpan di dimensi lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}RAPALAN SERENTAK: FIRE BALL x5\NRapalan Serentak: Fire Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia berhasil lolos?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shadow Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir yang bisa membelokkan ruang.\NIni sangat merepotkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian sudah lihat, kan?\NInilah sihir dimensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Percuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Percuma, percuma, percuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rapalan Serentak:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}RAPALAN SERENTAK: LIGHTNING BOLT x5
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}RAPALAN SERENTAK: LIGHTNING BOLT x5\NLightning Bolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ryusei...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, aku tertolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi itu nyaris, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.14,0:06:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu dulu peneliti sihir dimensi.\NKenapa melakukan hal seperti ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melakukan hal seperti ini, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini demi putriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di hari itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}putriku telah pergi selamanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, di dimensi ini dia masih hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dimensiku dan dimensi ini menyatu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dunia tempat putriku masih hidup\Nbersamaku akan tercipta.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putrinya dari dimensi lain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin mendapatkan kembali putriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu bisa terwujud,\Napa pun kulakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Amou...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.85,0:06:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata begitu. Kalau di dimensi lain,\Nada kemungkinan dia masih hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wahai penyihir di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.77,0:06:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu juga kehilangan orang\Nyang berharga bagimu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?\NMau bekerja sama denganku?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya, akan kugabungkan dunia\Ntempat orang yang berharga bagimu berada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenang saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak perlu cemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sensei, jangan dengarkan dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penggabungan dimensi\Nakan menelan banyak korban!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ryusei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tak perlu melakukan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada musuh baru?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}RAPALAN SERENTAK: FIRE BALL x5\NRapalan Serentak: Fire Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menganalisis sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan serangan sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.65,0:07:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyerapan sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku sudah ada di dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, kamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lama tak jumpa, Penyihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak terluka sedikit pun?\NSiapa kamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pembela keadilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan konyol.\NAku tak tahu siapa dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kamu tak akan bisa menghentikanku!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}RAPALAN SERENTAK: FIRE STORM x5\NRapalan Serentak: Fire Storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar.\NDia penyihir yang tak sabaran, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktuku tak banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menganalisis sihir.\NPertahanan serangan sihir. Penyerapan sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan ini pun bisa dibatalkan.\NDasar curang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.\NInilah kemampuan curangku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihirmu tak akan bisa mengenaiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:08:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serang!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.19,0:09:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Holy Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Seranganmu kuat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya aku Orang Suci.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Firasatku selalu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.71,0:09:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena... itu skill Pahlawan\Nyang selalu tepat sasaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo, Penyihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergi makan siang sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.27,0:09:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bukan Putri lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku Tsumugina Meru dari kelas 1-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tak keberatan,\Nmau makan siang bersama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}De-Dengan senang hati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apaan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?\NIni roti lapis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mau, silakan dimakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Ini buatanmu sendiri, Putri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi malu.\NAku belum terbiasa membuatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan begitu!\NAku senang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sangat enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senang mendengarnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekalian, bagaimana kalau kita\Nbahas banyak hal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tak keberatan, bisa ceritakan\Napa yang terjadi setelah aku mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ceritanya akan panjang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.45,0:10:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu menjadi Raja Undead
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan terus bertarung sendirian\Nmelawan Kekaisaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, kamu pasti sudah melewati\Nbanyak kesulitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu demi kepuasanku sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Roti lapisnya sangat enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Izinkan aku membalas budi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:11:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena sudah lama,\Nbagaimana kalau buatkan aku kopi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buatkan dia kopi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.92,0:11:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini biji kopi punya Hasegawa-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya pasti akan beda dari yang dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku suka melihatmu membuat kopi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini, silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kopi buatanmu memang\Nyang terbaik, ya, Penyihir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ingat, tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat aku diam-diam keluar istana\Ndan pergi ke kota di bawah istana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat aku diganggu para berandalan\Ndi gang sempit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu muncul dengan gagah\Ndan mengusir mereka dengan sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.62,0:11:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagiku itu sangat seru!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah itu, Raja tahu bahwa kamu\Npergi ke kota tanpa izin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.47,0:11:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan memarahimu habis-habisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:11:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat itulah, kamu juga\Nmembuatkan kopi untukku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.11,0:12:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin aku melupakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kenangan yang sangat berharga bagiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Komedi romantis?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Meteor, kamu kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sensei bertemu lagi dengan cinta pertamanya\Nyang selama ini dia kira sudah mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu hal yang tak bisa dijadikan candaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah kenapa aku jadi gelisah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuatanku serasa hilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga rasa gelisahmu itu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}suatu hari bisa kamu ungkapkan semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ini bicara apa?\NKamu itu polisi komedi romantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Polisi komedi romantis
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}selalu berpihak pada para gadis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, beri aku sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ingin aku sihir apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sihir yang membuat ototku jadi kekar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar kepala otot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih atas kerja samanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gadis Penyihir dari dimensi lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga berterima kasih atas bantuannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu Amou ditangkap,\Naku bingung harus berbuat apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kapan aurora itu hilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seiring waktu, kedua dimensi\Nharusnya akan saling menjauh
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan auroranya juga akan menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami bilang ke publik ini karena\Npengaruh badai matahari besar,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kita tak bisa terus menutupinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tak boleh lengah sampai aurora itu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}benar-benar menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ingin tahu lebih banyak,\Nsebaiknya tanya Amou.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sedang meneliti multisemesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga akan berusaha semampuku\Nagar kalian bisa kembali ke dimensi asal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sudah punya rencana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tadi dengar obrolan kami, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takanashi Ayame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar, kalian suka seenaknya\Nmenyuruh orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia Pahlawan yang kembali dari dunia lain
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan pernah meneliti sihir\Nuntuk membuka pintu dimensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, aku sudah dengar itu sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami juga sekelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kita bisa ke intinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau bekerja sama, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, aku akan ikut bantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya, lubang di dimensiku yang membuat\Norang bernama Amou itu datang kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.37,0:14:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, aku juga seorang Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sangat membantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, sihirnya sendiri\Nmasih belum sempurna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau Amou mau bekerja sama,\Nkurasa sihirnya bisa disempurnakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi dia ingin menghancurkan dunia ini, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia sudah benar-benar menyerah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin mendapatkan kembali putriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu bisa terwujud,\Napa pun kulakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin dia masih butuh waktu\Nuntuk merenungkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yakin dia pasti akan paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi itu seru!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bersamamu memang menyenangkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Panggil aku Meru!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri tetaplah Putri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.74,0:15:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri, kamu sudah bereinkarnasi\Nke dimensi lain, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak menyangka akan ada banyak dimensi\Ndi tempat aku bereinkarnasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan dengan kekuatan Orang Suci pun,\Nmelintasi dimensi bukan hal yang mudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa Putri datang ke dimensi ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak paham?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku melintasi dimensi\Ndemi bisa menemuimu, Penyihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga ingin bertemu denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini betulan komedi romantis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, dia betulan lakon wanita\Nkomedi romantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor-san, kamu betulan baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor, kamu kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, sudah jelas tidak baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu betulan Hanaori-kun, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sudah tak tertolong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa boleh buat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus turun tangan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saatnya operasi besar\Nmembangkitkan gadis culun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Culunnya tolong dihilangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suaranya kecil sekali...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, ayo kita rias dia agar lebih imut!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Secara fisik!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tak akan tanya kenapa dia jadi begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di situasi begini,\Nharus tahu akar masalahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti berkaitan dengan Sensei, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tebakannya benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadilah imut.\NJadilah imut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ada yang kurang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya biar aku yang coba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadilah imut...\NJadilah imut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadilah imut...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.03,0:16:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.47,0:17:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa pakai gaya Fujioka Hiroshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada ahkirnya tetap gagal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita sudah coba banyak cara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.93,0:17:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia dilempar ke sana kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi sekarang giliran kami, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal putri loli waktu itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, dia kebanting sama saingannya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bilang seolah-olah lagi adu cakep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesatria Komedi Romantis...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih tepatnya, Pejuang Cinta,\Nterluka parah karena komedi romantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sebabnya aku tak suka komedi romantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Pejuang Cinta itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga harusnya abaikan bagian itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pejuang Cinta adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik! Diam!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kalau kalian penyihir,\Nubah aku jadi Cinderella dengan sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia ini bicara apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.56,0:17:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau apel beracun, aku punya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalaupun kamu tidur, Pangeran tak akan\Npernah datang untuk menciummu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:17:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?\NSudah merasa baikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Penyihir Kompor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan memberiku julukan aneh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, wah.\NAda apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.65,0:18:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semangatku hilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.52,0:18:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu, sedang masa puber, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau hatimu lemah,\Npesona gadismu juga ikut lemah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat begini, obatnya makanan manis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau makan puding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau makan daifuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana dengan madu sarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Madu sarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya banyak jenis makanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, sebelum itu,\Nkita ukur suhu tubuhmu dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bilang semangatmu hilang,\Ntapi wajahmu sangat pucat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada bagian tubuhmu yang sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada yang sakit, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Belakangan ini tubuhku terasa lemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah cek ke rumah sakit pun,\Npenyebabnya tidak diketahui...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu mengkhawatirkan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan, kamu kena kutukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu menghancurkan patung Jizo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak pernah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku malah membuat semua orang cemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gelisah terus seperti ini juga percuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus bicara langsung dengan Ryusei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Auroranya... masih belum hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aneh, harusnya sudah waktunya\Naurora itu menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begini, Amou.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kamu\Ntetap tinggal di dunia ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tak bisa tinggal bersama putrimu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mungkin ada di dunia yang sama dengannya\Nbisa sedikit menenangkan hatimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu mustahil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.26,0:19:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diriku di dunia ini telah dikuasai\Nkegelapan multisemesta,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mendirikan sekte sesat,\Nmembuat banyak orang menderita,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan akhirnya menghilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kamu yakin kita membiarkan\Norang ini bebas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu khawatir aku akan kembali\Nmendistorsi dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:20:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanpa Mata Ouroboros,\Npenyatuan dimensi mustahil dilakukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.63,0:20:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Artefak yang bisa membuat sihir\Nbertahan selamanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.09,0:20:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah mendapatkannya di Earth 6,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku terpikirkan untuk membuat rencana itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya perlu mengunci
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.14,0:20:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sihir dimensi yang terhubung ke duniaku,\NEarth 13, agar terus terbuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat kedua dunia tersambung secara paksa,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}retakan dimensinya akan terus\Nmenekan ruang dan waktu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai akhirnya,\Nkedua dimensi itu terpaksa menyatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mata Ouroboros?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi benda itu betulan ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah kalian yang mengambilnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak tahu soal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lantas, siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang ada di tempat itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku, Sensei, Hanaori-san, dan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.37,0:22:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Auroranya indah, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ingat tidak, di dunia kita,\Naurora dianggap sebagai pertanda buruk?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, tapi yang ada di depan mata kita itu\Nbetulan membawa kesialan bagi dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan terus terang.\NWaktu kita sudah mepet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayangnya, dunia ini sudah berada\Ndi ambang kehancuran.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.38,0:22:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini ramalan Orang Suci?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.22,0:22:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia Ini Milikku.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kekuatan Orang Suci\Nyang bisa melihat segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkat kekuatan ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.48,0:22:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa menemukan jiwamu di antara dimensi\Nyang tak terhitung banyaknya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bilang punya tujuan, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.10,0:23:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku datang untuk menyelamatkanmu\Ndari dimensi ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyihir, aku menyukaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.51,0:23:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maukah kamu ikut denganku ke dimensiku?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.19,0:23:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perkembangannya cepat sekali, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimensinya...\NDunia ini sedang berubah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi mereka berdua masih saja begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.85,0:23:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini dimensi komedi romantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seram!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Juga menyebalkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.81,0:23:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga!
